        "refs": ["Q0001"]
      },
      "explanation_text": {
        "text": "A variable declared inside a code block is scoped to that block and cannot be accessed outside of it, resulting in a compilation error such as \"cannot resolve symbol\" when referenced elsewhere.",
        "refs": ["Q0001"]
